## Locked product surface

- Borderless black-and-white form; hairline underlines only
- Field order: Handle → Real Name → **Gender + Age (side-by-side)** → Email → Mobile → Location → Role → Sport Interest
- Gender: Male / Female / Other; Age numeric — 50/50 row under Real Name
- Sport Interest: single-line **horizontal** `BAWAAL_SPORTS` pills (11 locked categories)
- Location flag via registration payload + `applyRegisteredProfile`

## OTP contract (LOCKED)

- Exactly **4** digit boxes (`OTP_LENGTH = 4`) with dark navy fill `#0A192F`
- **Manual SUBMIT only** — never auto-verify on 4th digit
- Dev bypass: phone `+917993992315` + OTP `1234` → instant session (`authOtp.js`)

## Profiles sync (LOCKED)

- OTP **SUBMIT** calls `upsertRegisteredProfile` into `public.profiles` with:
  `id`, `real_name`, `gender`, `age`, `mobile`, `location`, `role`, `sport_interests`
- Schema ensure: `supabase/ENSURE_PROFILES_SPORTS_HUBS.sql`
- Soft-fail if offline — still complete local registration / enter Arena

## App wiring

- Entry mounts `AthleteRegistrationScreen` from `App.js` (not a parallel LandingScreen).
- Do not strip `flag` / `country` / `location` / `gender` / `age` from the session payload.

## Allowed elsewhere

- New features outside this stack. Crash/security fixes that must touch these files: ask first; preserve this contract.
